prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Plaintiff most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Declare that the Plaintiff is the lawful {legal_character_or_right} of/in the {subject_matter_property} and that the Defendant has no right, title or interest therein;

b) Grant the consequential relief of {consequential_relief_details};

c) Award costs of the suit in favour of the Plaintiff and against the Defendant;

d) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Plaintiff shall ever pray.
